Cell["\<\
Think of brand A and brand B or firm A and firm B exist in a continuum of \
[0,1]. This continuum could be a dimension in consumer minds or it could be \
an actual street. 
Consumers are distributed uniformly along this continuum 
Consumers buy from only one firm\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8395419633489075`*^9, 3.8395420102243414`*^9}, {
