Cell["\<\
If we can derive the position of x, then we can know that to the left of x, \
consumers will prefer brand A, and to the right of x, consumers will prefer \
brand B (because x is the middle/indifferent point).  \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.839547740035035*^9, 3.8395478647574425`*^9}, {
  3.83954789871647*^9, 3.8395479252299776`*^9}, {3.8395479696031704`*^9, 
