     RowBox[{"x", "-", "a"}], "|"}], " ", "="}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "1e5c9b90-d5bd-4320-99de-efdade495b6f"],
 " disutility of consuming a product away from ideal. Alternatively, we can \
think of t as the transportation cost parameters, weights on the distributary \
incur when they purchase a product different from the ideal point (or ideal \
location). \n\n",
 StyleBox["Condition",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ": Market is covered if all consumers buy. Since consumer with the lowest \
utility is the indifferent consumer (because he is furthest away from any of \
the sellers), we say the market is covered if the indifferent consumer buys, \
which effectively means that \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"V", "-", 
     RowBox[{"t", " ", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-", "a"}], "+", 
        FractionBox[
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"a", " ", "t"}], "+", 
          RowBox[{"b", " ", "t"}], "-", 
          SubscriptBox["p", "A"], "+", 
          SubscriptBox["p", "B"]}], 
         RowBox[{"2", " ", "t"}]]}], ")"}]}], "-", 
     SubscriptBox["p", "A"]}], ">", "0"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "7cd4b112-a542-400f-84b7-747baeeef1ca"],
 "\n\nHence, market share for firm A = ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   OverscriptBox["x", "_"], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "c281a72f-15f2-4b02-aba3-46eb7516d2f7"],
 " \nand market share for firm B = ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"1", "-", " ", 
    OverscriptBox["x", "_"]}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "945de2e6-6b61-4aa6-8e63-4183cbb05ef0"],
 " (because the continuum spans from [0,1], we could also use ",
 StyleBox["L in place of 1 for generalization, ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "where L = the total market share",
 ")\nThen, the profit function for each firm is "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8395434422055416`*^9, 3.839543471881834*^9}, {
   3.8395437795410585`*^9, 3.839543787390158*^9}, {3.8395438533719807`*^9, 
